  id: spell-burning-hands
  displayName: Burning Hands
  description: A thin sheet of flame shoots from your outstretched fingertips. Each creature in a 15-foot cone must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much on a successful one. A successful save takes half (a second, halved copy of the same damage effect).
